# 詞: 睇怕

1. 睇怕今日會落大雨，你出門記得帶遮。 (It looks like it's going to rain heavily today; remember to bring an umbrella when you go out.)
2. 佢遲到成半個鐘，睇怕都係塞車喇。 (He's half an hour late; it seems he's stuck in traffic.)
3. 呢個計劃咁複雜，睇怕要搞多幾個月先完成。 (This plan is so complicated; it looks like it'll take a few more months to finish.)
4. 佢成日唔返工，睇怕份工都唔做得耐。 (He's always absent from work; it seems he won't last long in this job.)
5. 睇怕今晚冇人會嚟食飯，我哋自己食啦。 (It looks like no one will come for dinner tonight; let's just eat by ourselves.)
6. 呢排物價咁貴，睇怕要慳啲使先得。 (Prices are so high these days; it seems we need to spend more carefully.)
7. 佢咁嬲，睇怕你都要道歉先得。 (He's so angry; it looks like you'll have to apologize first.)
8. 睇怕呢條隊要排好耐，不如我哋去第二間餐廳。 (It looks like this line will take a long time; let's go to another restaurant instead.)
9. 佢咁耐都冇覆我，睇怕佢唔想理我。 (He hasn't replied to me for so long; it seems he doesn't want to deal with me.)
10. 睇怕呢個問題冇咁易解決，要慢慢諗辦法。 (It looks like this problem won't be solved easily; we need to think of a solution slowly.) [end of text]


